@host = http://localhost:5258
@placeId = 1

### Get all places (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/places
Accept: application/json

### Get place by id (admin, fully nested, hidden included)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/places/{{placeId}}
Accept: application/json


### PATCH place — valid (this one should return 200)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/admin/places/{{placeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

